window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-022-1800a7f2816cb222.json"]={sha256:"1800a7f2816cb222ef29b2107209762c14108cd9b74a857bcf16014c7ec74b7b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-022","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-022","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-023","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/"],"title":"ECN：標記比例的正確分母與時間窗","titleEn":"ECN: correct denominators and windows for marking ratios","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付事件線、單位轉換、class 映射與餘裕表，另列 cell 取整與 pipeline 尚未建模的項目；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the event timeline, unit conversion, traffic-class mapping and headroom table, listing cell rounding and pipeline terms that remain unmodeled before any real configuration decision. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 packet_id、class、window、ecn 欄位；以篩選後集合產生分子分母清單，再與原始總量比對。","differenceEn":"Build packet_id, class, window and ecn fields. Materialize numerator and denominator memberships after filtering, then reconcile them with raw totals so scope errors remain visible.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["簡化餘裕為線速位元組率乘反應時間再加一個最大框；忽略晶片 cell 取整、額外 pipeline 與共享池競爭；教學資料率 25 GB/s，最大框 9000 B；反應時間由 3 微秒增加為 5 微秒；名義式 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B；變更式 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比例為同方向、同 class、同時間窗內 CE 標記封包除以可評估封包數；標記數不是位元組數也不是丟包數；兩組均有 1000 個 CE 標記封包；合格封包總數由 10000 改為 5000，無重置或取樣遺失；名義式 1000/10000*100 = 10 %；變更式 1000/5000*100 = 20 %。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Simplified headroom equals byte rate times reaction time plus one maximum frame. Hardware cell rounding, additional pipelines and competition for shared buffers are excluded and must be added before operational configuration. Use a synthetic 25 decimal GB/s arrival rate and a 9000-byte maximum frame. Reaction time increases from 3 to 5 microseconds, with no claim that either value is a switch’s configured default. Nominal 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B; changed 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","The ratio divides CE-marked packets by eligible packets from the same direction, class and interval. Mark counts are not byte totals, drop counts or a direct measure of receiver throughput. Both fixtures have 1000 CE-marked packets. Eligible packet totals change from 10000 to 5000, with no counter reset or missing samples and with stable classification. Nominal 1000/10000*100 = 10 %; changed 1000/5000*100 = 20 %. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-032","referenceUrls":["https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/"],"title":"Lustre：並行寫入的半開區間與重疊證明","titleEn":"Lustre: half-open intervals for concurrent-write ownership","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付事件線、單位轉換、class 映射與餘裕表，另列 cell 取整與 pipeline 尚未建模的項目；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the event timeline, unit conversion, traffic-class mapping and headroom table, listing cell rounding and pipeline terms that remain unmodeled before any real configuration decision. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 writer_id、start、length、pattern，展開小型位元組模型並記錄每個位置的 writer 集合。","differenceEn":"Read writer identity, start, length and data pattern. Expand a reduced byte-level model and retain the set of writers for each position, distinguishing intended ownership from whichever write happens last.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["簡化餘裕為線速位元組率乘反應時間再加一個最大框；忽略晶片 cell 取整、額外 pipeline 與共享池競爭；教學資料率 25 GB/s，最大框 9000 B；反應時間由 3 微秒增加為 5 微秒；名義式 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B；變更式 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","兩半開區間交集長度為 max(0,min(endA,endB)-max(startA,startB))；相接端點不算共享位元組；A 寫 [0,3) MiB；B 名義寫 [3,6)，變更寫 [2,5)；各程序長度均為 3 MiB；名義式 max(0,min(3,6)-max(0,3)) = 0 MiB overlap；變更式 max(0,min(3,5)-max(0,2)) = 1 MiB overlap。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Simplified headroom equals byte rate times reaction time plus one maximum frame. Hardware cell rounding, additional pipelines and competition for shared buffers are excluded and must be added before operational configuration. Use a synthetic 25 decimal GB/s arrival rate and a 9000-byte maximum frame. Reaction time increases from 3 to 5 microseconds, with no claim that either value is a switch’s configured default. Nominal 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B; changed 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Overlap length of two half-open intervals is the positive difference between the smaller end and larger start. Adjacent endpoints do not share bytes under this explicitly chosen interval convention. Writer A owns [0,3) MiB. Writer B changes from [3,6) to [2,5), retaining a 3 MiB length in both cases. Offset ranges are synthetic and do not describe Lustre’s actual lock extents. Nominal max(0,min(3,6)-max(0,3)) = 0 MiB overlap; changed max(0,min(3,5)-max(0,2)) = 1 MiB overlap. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-856df3e3986f0a20","url":"https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/","title":"Lustre parallel filesystems","titleEn":"Lustre parallel filesystems","publisher":"LUMI consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
